+# formatBytes notes
+
+## Plan
+1. Add `formatBytes(n)` to `src/cli/bytes.ts`: B, KiB, MiB, GiB, one decimal.
+2. Add `test/cli/bytes.test.ts` (node:test).
+3. Run `npm run fast`, then commit.
+
+## Decisions
+- Units step at 1024. GiB is the top unit (no TiB).
+- One decimal always, e.g. `0.0 B`, `1.5 KiB`.
+- Non-finite or negative input throws RangeError.
+- Rounding up to 1024.0 promotes to the next unit (1048575 -> `1.0 MiB`).
+
+## Status
+- [x] plan written
+- [x] implementation and tests written
+- [x] npm run fast passes (needed a shard weight in scripts/lib/shard-weights.mjs; notes live in docs/notes because docs/program/*.md is budgeted as instructions)
